sequenceDiagram
    participant Scout
    participant Visual as Visual Forensics
    participant Text as Text Consistency
    participant Graph as Seller Network
    participant Price as Price Anomaly
    participant MS as Mystery Shopper
    participant Fusion as Confidence Fusion
    participant Legal as Legal Escalation
    participant Human as Human Reviewer

    Scout->>Scout: Discover listing
    Scout->>Visual: Handoff
    Visual->>Visual: Packaging mismatch found (+15%)
    Visual->>Text: Handoff
    Text->>Text: Spec check (consistent, +0%)
    Text->>Graph: Handoff
    Graph->>Graph: Linked to 12 known counterfeit sellers (+20%)
    Graph->>Visual: Compare logos across these 3 related sellers?
    Visual-->>Graph: 92% similarity
    Graph->>Graph: Network confirmed (+10%)
    Graph->>Price: Handoff
    Price->>Price: 61% below median, no return policy (+8%)
    Price->>MS: Handoff
    MS->>MS: Requests invoice from seller
    MS->>MS: Seller evasive (+18%)
    MS->>Price: If invoice existed, still suspicious?
    Price-->>MS: No — invoice would resolve the flag
    MS->>Fusion: Handoff
    Fusion->>Fusion: Confidence 71% -> likely_counterfeit
    Fusion->>Legal: Escalate
    Legal->>Legal: Draft takedown notice
    Legal->>Human: Route for approval (NOT auto-filed)
